SUMMARY:Sophie Duker: Hot Beef Injection
LOCATION:The Bell House\, Carroll Gardens-Cobble Hill-Gowanus-Red Hook
DESCRIPTION:As part of The New York Comedy Festival. Taskmaster Champion\, 
 
Edinburgh Comedy Award Best Newcomer Nominee & retired sugar daughter Sophi
 
e Duker is back w/ a brand-new 2026-27 stand-up tour\, 'Hot Beef Injection'
 
. In her latest hour\, Sophie dares to get both sexy & political\, reflecti
 
ng on hypermasculinity\, heavy-handed handymen & that old-chestnut Would Yo
 
u Rather: 'Man or Bear?'. Hot Beef Injection reckons w/ the primal fear dri
 
ving Duker's distrust of heterosexual he/hims. And out of a challenging com
 
edy club encounter a new question emerges: what would she say if she spoke 
 
to men\, instead of shutting them out? Door Time: 9:30pm. Show Time: 10pm. 
 
*Join us in our lobby bar prior to door time! 21 & over w/ valid\, governme
 
nt-issued photo ID. General Admission standing & seating. *Seating 1st come
 
 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive early for best selection. **If you hav
 
e an accessibility request\, please email thebellhouse@livenation.com prior
 
. No outside food/drink. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/sophi
 
e-duker-hot-beef-injection-brooklyn-new-york-11-12-2026/event/3000650C1BBFF
 
D40
